#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_440.rst:280
msgid "Breaking Enhancements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_440.rst:282
msgid ""
"**Routing:** The method signature of ``RouteCollection::__construct()`` "
"has been changed. The third parameter ``Routing $routing`` has been "
"added. Extending classes should likewise add the parameter so as not to "
"break LSP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_440.rst:285
msgid ""
"**Validation:** The method signature of ``Validation::check()`` has been "
"changed. The ``string`` typehint on the ``$rule`` parameter was removed. "
"Extending classes should likewise remove the typehint so as not to break "
"LSP."
msgstr ""

